{
  "name": "Ragfeed: RAG pipeline – web page to chunks, embeddings, Qdrant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b01",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b02",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Retrieval-augmented_generation",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b03",
      "name": "URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.ragfeed.de/v2/scrape",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $json.url }}\",\n  \"formats\": [\n    { \"type\": \"chunks\", \"maxTokens\": 500 }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b04",
      "name": "Ragfeed: page to chunks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "ragfeed-header",
          "name": "Ragfeed (Header)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data.chunks",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b05",
      "name": "One item per chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"model\": \"text-embedding-3-small\", \"input\": $json.embedText } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b06",
      "name": "Create embedding",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [880, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai",
          "name": "OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b07",
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ $('One item per chunk').item.json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b08",
              "name": "vector",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].embedding }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b09",
              "name": "payload",
              "value": "={{ { \"text\": $('One item per chunk').item.json.text, \"heading\": $('One item per chunk').item.json.heading, \"metadata\": $('One item per chunk').item.json.metadata } }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b0a",
      "name": "Build Qdrant point",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1100, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "https://YOUR-QDRANT-HOST:6333/collections/ragfeed/points?wait=true",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"points\": [ { \"id\": $json.id, \"vector\": $json.vector, \"payload\": $json.payload } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b0b",
      "name": "Store in Qdrant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1320, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A full RAG pipeline, HTTP nodes only\n\nWeb page → ready chunks (Ragfeed) → embedding (OpenAI) → vector store (Qdrant). Built-in nodes only, no extra packages.\n\n**Why it stays duplicate-free:** each chunk's `id` is a stable UUID from the URL and position. It becomes the Qdrant point id directly. Re-fetch the same page and Qdrant overwrites the same point instead of adding a second one.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. **Header Auth** for Ragfeed: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer ` + your key (`sk-…`).\n2. **OpenAI** credential in *Create embedding*.\n3. In *Store in Qdrant* set `YOUR-QDRANT-HOST` and the collection `ragfeed`. On Qdrant Cloud add an `api-key` header.\n\n**Important:** the embedding model's dimension must match the Qdrant collection (`text-embedding-3-small` = 1536). Create the collection with that size first.\n\nRagfeed cost: 1 credit per page, chunks cost nothing extra.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "182a3b4c-0008-4a80-9b08-7f8e9d0c1b0c",
      "name": "Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 180]
    }
  ],
